<!--
id: C02
name: Credits out
layout: base
kind: campaign
sender: hi
category: credits
topic: credit-alerts
trigger: event credits_exhausted; at most once every 25 days per person
phase: 2
subject: You've used all your credits
preheader: Two ways to keep generating.
footer_reason: You're receiving this because a generation on your Hydrilla account was blocked by your credit balance.
optional: true
data: event.plan, event.reset_on, event.pricing_url
-->
<mj-text>Hi {{ customer.first_name | default: "there" }},</mj-text>
<mj-text>Your last generation couldn't start because there aren't enough credits left in your balance.</mj-text>
<mj-text>You can wait until {{ event.reset_on | default: "your next reset" }}, when your credits reset, or move to a plan with more credits and keep going now.</mj-text>
<mj-button href="{{ event.pricing_url | default: 'https://hydrilla.ai/app/pricing' }}">See plans</mj-button>
